        <updated>2025-11-04T13:03:11.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">See the proposed structure at <a href="https://github.com/dipikabh/mdn-css-reorg/blob/main/css-tree-proposed.json">css-tree-proposed.json</a>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Steps performed</h3>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto">Created the <code class="notranslate">css/reference/at-rules</code> directory and a listing page for "At-rules" (<code class="notranslate">files/en-us/web/css/reference/at-rules/index.md</code>).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Moved the existing <code class="notranslate">css_syntax/at-rule_functions</code> directory under <code class="notranslate">css/reference/at-rules</code>.</p>
 <details>
 <summary>Breadcrumb screenshot for at-rule functions before the reorg:</summary>
 <kbd><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/509132102-e5b72bc6-24f7-42d5-9eb6-d7db16bdfd3c.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ap7VQ-oTjtto-Cjp9v2MDsoNXrfu7oyWRLbjQL2Ihl4"><img width="460" height="100" alt="breadcrumb for at-rule functions before the reorganization" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/509132102-e5b72bc6-24f7-42d5-9eb6-d7db16bdfd3c.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ap7VQ-oTjtto-Cjp9v2MDsoNXrfu7oyWRLbjQL2Ihl4" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 100px;"></a></kbd>
 </details>
 <details>
 <summary>Breadcrumb screenshot for at-rule functions after the reorg:</summary>
 <kbd><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/509132106-9bbde155-198a-4b99-ae9e-a4b574038d50.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..0ssxmTUSt6zJJnbYbMjzIgaHCHT4D9BuqFQXDkd4D-M"><img width="460" height="100" alt="breadcrumb for at-rule functions after the reorganization" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/509132106-9bbde155-198a-4b99-ae9e-a4b574038d50.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..0ssxmTUSt6zJJnbYbMjzIgaHCHT4D9BuqFQXDkd4D-M" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 100px;"></a></kbd>
 </details>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Moved all pages with <code class="notranslate">page-type: css-at-rule</code> and their child directories (e.g., <code class="notranslate">@page/page-orientation</code>) under <code class="notranslate">css/reference/at-rules</code>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Updated paths in the sidebar (<code class="notranslate">files/sidebars/cssref.yaml</code>) for "At-rules" and added a link for the new listing page.<br>
Also removed the entry <code class="notranslate">Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule_functions</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule_functions" rel="nofollow">current link</a>) from the <code class="notranslate">Syntax</code> guide grouping (<a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/f336c5b6795a562c64fe859aa9ee2becf223ad8a/files/sidebars/cssref.yaml#L258">link to code on GH</a>) to correctly reflect the hierarchy in breadcrumbs (as shown in previous screenshot).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-note" dir="auto"><p class="markdown-alert-title" dir="auto"><svg class="octicon octicon-info mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>After the reorg, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule_functions" rel="nofollow">At-rule functions</a> will no longer be linked from the sidebar. This needs to be addressed in the future.</li>
<li>Also note that at-rule descriptors (such as the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@font-palette-values/font-family" rel="nofollow">font-family</a> descriptor) currently don't appear in the sidebar. Using "<code class="notranslate">depth: 2</code> with <code class="notranslate">tags: css-at-rule-descriptor</code>" doesn't solve this because descriptors get listed at the same level as their parent at-rules, rather than being nested as child nodes under respective at-rules. A proper hierarchical solution is needed.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<ol start="5" dir="auto">
<li>Removed the "Index" from the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule" rel="nofollow">At-rules guide</a>. Updated its slug to make it plural, from <code class="notranslate">Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rule</code> to <code class="notranslate">Web/CSS/CSS_syntax/At-rules</code>. Added this guide to the sidebar (instead of the At-rule functions).</li>
</ol>
